        "jurisdiction_note": "We sell to customers in any country in the world from outside the European Union. Products ship from our international supplier’s warehouse. If you buy from Spain or another European Union country, you keep the rights granted to you under European consumer law, including the right of withdrawal and the legal guarantee of conformity, under the terms detailed below. If you buy from outside the European Union, we apply these same terms as a minimum standard, without prejudice to any additional rights granted to you under your country’s laws.",
